# note: Purdue Gautschi, cpu partition: one task of 4 cores. One array element
#       per input; --concurrency N caps how many run at once, so 16 of these
#       is 64 cores in flight. Pass --account for your own allocation.
# require: --account
--scheduler
slurm
--queue
cpu
--nodes
1
--cores
4
--walltime
4h
